config MESHTASTIC_STORAGE_STATS
	bool "Storage report (meshtastic storage)"
	default y
	depends on MESHTASTIC_SETTINGS
	help
	  A read-only report of the settings store: sector layout, free space
	  (NVS backends), and per-subtree record counts, value bytes, estimated
	  on-flash bytes and lockdown-sealed counts, plus how long the config,
	  node-key and node-record restores took at boot. Shell command
	  `meshtastic storage`; API meshtastic_storage_stats().

	  Exists because nothing measured settings use while the XIAO's 32 KB
	  partition is shared by everything that persists (agents-oaz1).
